    "Solo lectura: en esta versión HÅLSYN no escribe nada en Apple Health. Podrás elegir qué tipos compartir en la hoja de permisos de iOS.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only: in this version, HÅLSYN doesn't write anything to Apple Health. You'll be able to choose which types to share in the iOS permissions sheet."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somente leitura: nesta versão, o HÅLSYN não grava nada no Apple Health. Você poderá escolher quais tipos compartilhar na tela de permissões do iOS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lecture seule : dans cette version, HÅLSYN n’écrit rien dans Apple Health. Tu pourras choisir les types à partager dans la fenêtre d’autorisations d’iOS."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo lettura: in questa versione HÅLSYN non scrive nulla in Apple Health. Potrai scegliere quali tipi condividere nella schermata delle autorizzazioni di iOS."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Endast läsning: i den här versionen skriver HÅLSYN ingenting till Apple Health. Du kan välja vilka typer du delar i iOS-behörighetsrutan."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kun læsning: i denne version skriver HÅLSYN intet til Apple Health. Du kan vælge, hvilke typer du deler, i iOS' tilladelsesark."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取：此版本的 HÅLSYN 不会向 Apple Health 写入任何内容。你可以在 iOS 权限页面中选择要共享的数据类型。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "केवल पढ़ना: इस वर्शन में HÅLSYN, Apple Health में कुछ भी नहीं लिखता। आप iOS की अनुमति शीट में चुन सकेंगे कि कौन-से प्रकार शेयर करने हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
